# Spark IDE keymap — proven keys, show (`w`) focus.
# After save forms. Show already in asm — this slice documents+tests
# the `w` token like save (`s`) / run (`r`) / quit (`q`).
# Dry: script `w` → {"cmd":"show"} + editor.ppm validate; open still reads.
# Also proves single `ide key show` after open.
# Run: ./spark --dry-run examples/ide_keys_show.spark
# No Electron. No new asm — documents proven keys only.

ide keys "examples/fixtures/ide/cmds_show.txt"

ide key open "examples/hello.spark"

ide key show
